# The two parquet caches are committed as a point-in-time snapshot, so the
# published numbers can be reproduced without a ~50 minute rebuild. See
# "Cache snapshot policy" in the README: they are refreshed when results are
# published, not on every pull. Anything else under data/ stays local.
data/*
!data/raw_hourly.parquet
!data/daily.parquet
# data/clv_log.parquet and data/clv_pred.parquet are deliberately NOT listed
# here: they are runtime output of the daily job, not repository content. They
# stay ignored by the data/* rule above. On a host where the log must survive,
# back up the data directory rather than committing it -- see DEPLOY.md.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
